  "body": "We allow no-cors requests to have `Range` headers as long as it's set by an internal API, and the request is unmodified.\r\n\r\nIt feels like CORS requests should be able to use `Range` in particular ways without triggering a preflight. If the format matches what https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-add-range-header can create, that's ok right?",
